{"seq":1,"slug":"research-methodology","title":"研究方法论","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/research-methodology","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"研究方法论-简介\">研究方法论 简介</h1><p>研究方法论是研究生阶段最为基础也最为关键的一门学科素养，它为所有学术研究提供认识论依据和操作性指引。无论攻读哪一专业方向，扎实的方法论训练都是产出高质量学位论文和学术成果的前提条件。</p>\n<p>本课程以&quot;从范式选择到论文完成&quot;为主线，将研究方法论的核心内容系统地组织为四个章节，循序渐进地引导自学者掌握学术研究的完整流程。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>研究范式与方法论基础</strong>着眼于认识论层面，帮助学习者理解实证主义与诠释主义两大传统的内在逻辑，辨析质性研究与量化研究的适用边界，并掌握混合方法研究的设计要领。选择合适的研究范式是一切后续工作的起点。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>文献综述与理论框架</strong>聚焦于研究准备阶段最重要的智力活动。系统综述方法的规范流程、理论框架的建构策略，以及如何精准识别研究空白，都是开题和论文写作中经常被低估却极为关键的环节。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>数据采集与实验设计</strong>转向研究的实操层面，涵盖问卷调查设计、访谈方法和实验设计三种最常用的数据收集手段。每种方法都有其独特的信效度考量和伦理要求，掌握这些要点将直接决定研究数据的可靠性。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>论文写作与答辩流程</strong>关注研究成果的最终呈现。从学位论文的整体结构规划，到同行评审与学术发表的规则，再到答辩的准备策略，这些知识帮助学习者顺利走完从研究构想到成果产出的最后一步。</p>\n<p>建议学习者先从第一章出发建立研究认识论框架，再按顺序推进至第四章。在学习过程中，可以结合自己的选题方向反复对照各章内容，将抽象的方法论原则转化为具体的研究方案。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"research-paradigms","title":"研究范式与方法论基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/research-methodology/research-paradigms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"positivism-interpretivism","title":"研究生 研究方法论 — 实证主义与诠释主义","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/research-methodology/research-paradigms/positivism-interpretivism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"qualitative-vs-quantitative","title":"研究生 研究方法论 — 质性研究与量化研究","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/research-methodology/research-paradigms/qualitative-vs-quantitative"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mixed-methods-design","title":"研究生 研究方法论 — 混合方法研究设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/research-methodology/research-paradigms/mixed-methods-design"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"literature-review","title":"文献综述与理论框架","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/research-methodology/literature-review","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"systematic-review","title":"研究生 研究方法论 — 系统综述方法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/research-methodology/literature-review/systematic-review"},{"seq":2,"slug":"theoretical-framework","title":"研究生 研究方法论 — 理论框架建构","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/research-methodology/literature-review/theoretical-framework"},{"seq":3,"slug":"research-gap-analysis","title":"研究生 研究方法论 — 研究空白识别与分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/research-methodology/literature-review/research-gap-analysis"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-collection","title":"数据采集与实验设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/research-methodology/data-collection","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"survey-design","title":"研究生 研究方法论 — 问卷调查设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/research-methodology/data-collection/survey-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"interview-methods","title":"研究生 研究方法论 — 访谈方法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/research-methodology/data-collection/interview-methods"},{"seq":3,"slug":"experimental-design","title":"研究生 研究方法论 — 实验设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/research-methodology/data-collection/experimental-design"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"thesis-process","title":"论文写作与答辩流程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/research-methodology/thesis-process","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"thesis-structure","title":"研究生 研究方法论 — 学位论文结构","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/research-methodology/thesis-process/thesis-structure"},{"seq":2,"slug":"peer-review-publishing","title":"研究生 研究方法论 — 同行评审与学术发表","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/research-methodology/thesis-process/peer-review-publishing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"defense-preparation","title":"研究生 研究方法论 — 答辩准备","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/research-methodology/thesis-process/defense-preparation"}]}]}